{
  "name": "Day 63 Solution: Complete Automation Systems",
  "description": "End-to-end lead pipeline chaining 6 tools -- webhook, OpenAI enrichment, Airtable storage, Gmail welcome email, Slack sales alert, Notion follow-up task, Telegram notification -- with an explicit success check and system-alerts fallback after the Airtable store step.",
  "tags": [
    "week9",
    "real-tools",
    "complete-system",
    "lead-generation",
    "multi-tool"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "overview-sticky",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        140,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 63 Solution: Complete Automation Systems\n\nThe full lead-generation chain: a form webhook flows through AI enrichment, Airtable storage, a welcome email, a Slack sales alert, a Notion follow-up task, and a Telegram notification -- 6 external tools end to end (Airtable, Gmail, Slack, Notion, Telegram, plus OpenAI for enrichment).\n\n**Credentials needed to run for real:** Airtable Personal Access Token, Gmail OAuth2, Slack OAuth2, Notion API, Telegram Bot Token, OpenAI API key.\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_63_Complete_Automation_Systems.md for the full task.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "data-flow-sketch",
      "name": "Data Flow Sketch",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        660,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Data flow sketch (written before building)\n\nForm submission --(name,email,company,message)--> AI enrichment --(+score,+industry)--> Airtable storage --(lead record)--> [branch: store OK?]\n  -> yes: welcome email --(name,email)--> Slack sales alert --(lead summary)--> Notion follow-up task --(title,due date)--> Telegram notify --(lead summary)\n  -> no: Slack #system-alerts (\"Airtable store failed for lead X\")\n\nEvery arrow above carries the lead_id so the same lead can be traced across all five destination systems.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "error-handling-sticky",
      "name": "Error Handling Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1120,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Error handling approach\n\nIn production you'd set n8n's per-node **On Error** setting (Continue Using Error Output / Retry) on every risky call below -- Airtable, Gmail, Slack, Notion, Telegram -- so one bad API call doesn't kill the whole execution silently. This demo additionally adds ONE explicit IF node after the Airtable store step, checking a simulated success flag, and routes failures to a dedicated Slack #system-alerts channel instead of failing invisibly.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 340
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lead-intake-webhook",
      "name": "Lead Intake Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        160,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "lead-intake",
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "clean-lead-fields",
      "name": "Clean Lead Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        420,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "lead_id",
              "value": "={{ $now.format('yyyyMMddHHmmss') }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.name }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.email }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "company",
              "value": "={{ $json.company }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.message }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "source",
              "value": "={{ $json.source || 'website' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "score-enrich-lead",
      "name": "Score & Enrich Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.openAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        680,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "create",
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You score and enrich inbound leads. Respond ONLY with strict JSON: {\"lead_score\": number (1-10), \"industry\": string, \"recommended_action\": string}."
            },
            {
              "role": "user",
              "content": "={{ 'Name: ' + $json.name + '\\nCompany: ' + $json.company + '\\nMessage: ' + $json.message }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3,
          "maxTokens": 250
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "parse-lead-enrichment",
      "name": "Parse Lead Enrichment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        940,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "lead_id",
              "value": "={{ $('Clean Lead Fields').item.json.lead_id }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $('Clean Lead Fields').item.json.name }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $('Clean Lead Fields').item.json.email }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "company",
              "value": "={{ $('Clean Lead Fields').item.json.company }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "lead_score",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).lead_score }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "industry",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).industry }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "recommended_action",
              "value": "={{ JSON.parse($json.choices[0].message.content).recommended_action }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "store-lead-airtable",
      "name": "Store Lead in Airtable",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_base_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "table": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Leads",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Lead ID": "={{ $json.lead_id }}",
            "Name": "={{ $json.name }}",
            "Email": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "Company": "={{ $json.company }}",
            "Lead Score": "={{ $json.lead_score }}",
            "Industry": "={{ $json.industry }}",
            "Status": "New"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check-store-success",
      "name": "Check Airtable Store Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "store-ok-c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "system-alert",
      "name": "System Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1720,
        640
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": "#system-alerts",
        "text": "={{ '\u26a0\ufe0f Airtable store failed for lead ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.lead_id + ' (' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.name + '). Investigate the Airtable credential/base before retrying.' }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-welcome-email",
      "name": "Send Welcome Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1720,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ 'Welcome, ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.name + '!' }}",
        "message": "={{ 'Hi ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.name + ',\\n\\nThanks for reaching out! We received your message and will follow up within 24 hours.' }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "notify-sales-team",
      "name": "Notify Sales Team",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1980,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "post",
        "channel": "#sales-leads",
        "text": "={{ '\ud83c\udfaf New lead: ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.name + ' (' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.company + ')\\nScore: ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.lead_score + '\\nIndustry: ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.industry }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "create-followup-task",
      "name": "Create Follow-up Task",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2240,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "create",
        "databaseId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "your_database_id",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "title": "={{ 'Follow up with ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.name }}",
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "Priority|select",
              "selectValue": "={{ $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.lead_score > 7 ? 'High' : 'Medium' }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Status|select",
              "selectValue": "To Do"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-team-notification",
      "name": "Send Team Notification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        2500,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "your_chat_id",
        "text": "={{ '\ud83d\udcc8 Lead through full pipeline: ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.name + ' from ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.company + ' (score ' + $('Parse Lead Enrichment').item.json.lead_score + ')' }}"
      }
    }
  ],
